   "html": "<p>IHC commissioned Jonny Rabbit, Gorge Garza, Shizu Saldamando, and Tracy Guiteau to create portraits inspired by the people of the Talokan and Wakandan communities. Their mission was to masterfully incorporate the film’s underlying pillars of tradition and celebrate the powerful women behind them. </p>\n<p>The gallery was produced for a special Straw Hat Goofy prescreening of the film at the Cinemark Theatre in Playa Vista. </p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "The artwork",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Disney featured the work of all four artists across their official Marvel Studios and Black Panther Instagrams and elected to use the artwork for a special auction in support of the Chadwick Boseman foundation.</p>"
